<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Home | Maple Bistro</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        nav {
            background-color: #6b2410;
            padding: 16px;
        }
        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-right: 20px;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .hero {
            background-image: url("bg-food.jpg");
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            min-height: 480px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            border-bottom: 8px solid #6b2410;
        }
        .hero-text {
            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
            padding: 30px 45px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            max-width: 750px;
            margin: 20px;
        }
        .hero-text h1 {
            font-size: 48px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
        }
        .hero-text p {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }
        .container {
            width: 85%;
            margin: 50px auto;
        }
        .intro-section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #6b2410;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-size:26px;
        }
        p {
            margin-bottom:14px;
            font-size:17px;
        }
        .highlight-box {
            background-color: #fff2ec;
            border-left: 6px solid #c96b48;
            padding:20px;
            margin:30px 0;
        }
        footer {
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">About Us</a>
        <a href="gallery.html">Gallery</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero">
        <div class="hero-text">
            <h1>Maple Bistro</h1>
            <p>Authentic Canadian Comfort Food & Famous Poutine</p>
            <p>Fresh fries, real cheese curds, rich homemade gravy, and a cozy place to share great meals with friends.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="intro-section">
            <h2>Welcome to Maple Bistro</h2>
            <p>
                Here at Maple Bistro, we celebrate classic Canadian comfort food, with our signature dish being poutine.
                Poutine started in Quebec and has grown to become one of Canada’s most famous meals. We make every batch
                fresh with crispy golden fries, soft cheese curds, and rich homemade gravy.
            </p>
            <p>
                We believe great food brings people together. Whether you are stopping by for a quick lunch, hanging out
                with friends, or coming for a relaxing dinner, our restaurant is a warm and friendly place for everyone.
                Our team works hard to keep our food tasty, fresh, and affordable for all guests.
            </p>
            <p>
                Besides our famous poutine, we also serve light appetizers, fresh seafood bites, local coffee, sweet pastries,
                homemade butter tarts, smoked meat sandwiches, and our well-loved ketchup chips. We pick high-quality ingredients whenever possible and support local suppliers nearby.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="highlight-box">
            <h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>
            <p>✅ Freshly cooked fries made to order every day</p>
            <p>✅ Real cheese curds, not shredded cheese</p>
            <p>✅ Homemade gravy slow simmered for deep flavour</p>
            <p>✅ Classic Canadian snacks and desserts like butter tarts</p>
            <p>✅ Friendly service and cozy casual dining space</p>
            <p>✅ Great menu choices for snacks, meals and desserts</p>
        </div>

        <div class="intro-section">
            <h2>Come Visit Us Soon!</h2>
            <p>
                Explore our gallery page to look at all our menu items. If you have any questions or want to book a table,
                you can send us a message on our contact page. We can’t wait to serve you!
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>ICS3U Project | Grace & Yuna</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
